"""RIGHTS-HELD-FILL: the 36 formerly rights_held datasets (180 epoch-0 contexts) of the frozen acquisition-capped clean
bucket, rebuilt train-only on the raw route. Owner ruling ALL-DATA-RESEARCH + RIGHTS-HELD-FILL (owner-decisions-
20261006T102636Z.json, delegated, relayed). The LEAK RULE is unchanged.

Same builder and gates as ROWSEL-RAW-v2 / its coverage tree: tools/v2_rowsel_raw.run_dataset (universe, value-free pre-cap,
split v2, per-fold selection, both counterfactual gates, dataset-atomic .done) with the coverage tree's loader/matcher
(tools/v2_rowsel_raw_coverage.make_loader / matcher: first content match) or, for a dataset whose first match fails with
rows_unmatched_nonnumeric_raw, the raw builder's nonnumeric loader / matcher / text gate (CORESET-NONNUMERIC route). This
module only supplies plan entries and inputs; it changes no gate. What differs, all recorded in every receipt:
  rights     the rights gate is lifted for these 36 (held=set()); every dataset record and context.json carries
             rights="research-only" (research-only/ routing, which the owner permits for formerly rights-held sets),
             rights_basis="formerly_rights_held" and rights_decision=<ALL-DATA-RESEARCH file>#sha256=<sha>
  raw        RUN/inputs/t1-raw-formerly-held (tools/l7a_fetch.py, the acquisition's own socrata_csv_url; fetch-run receipt
             pinned); for the nonnumeric route the raw builder's module global RAW_DIR is pointed there in this process
  epoch-0    `bundle` runs the unmodified scale_check.Sources + resolve_context on the lane host (xbabe2: the epoch file
             names absolute paths under other projects' roots) into a create-only, sha-pinned bundle; `--epoch0 bundle`
             replays it (scale_check.resolve_context and Sources replaced in this process only; every array sha256-checked
             against the bundle index). `--epoch0 live` uses the real functions (the xbabe2 pilot for the equivalence proof).
  hold       047d631d7f3c0e9c: registry annotated group column; the raw route has no v2-groups split (main HOLD 10:4xZ)
  guard      `--guard xbabe3`: pause while MemAvailable < 20 % of MemTotal, 1-min load > 0.85 x cores, or / free < 300 GB
             (the lane's cpuguard reads an xbabe2-only admission file); `--guard lane` = dltrain.cpuguard (xbabe2)

Usage (PYTHONPATH = the frozen source snapshot this file sits in):
  v2_rowsel_raw_fill.py bundle    --bundle DIR
  v2_rowsel_raw_fill.py study     --bundle DIR --study PATH [--datasets h1,..]
  v2_rowsel_raw_fill.py plan      --bundle DIR --study PATH --out DIR --of N --split-version rowsel-raw-split-v2
  v2_rowsel_raw_fill.py build     --bundle DIR --out DIR --shard I --of N --split-version rowsel-raw-split-v2 [--datasets ..]
                                  [--epoch0 bundle|live] [--guard xbabe3|lane] [--replay-match-utc JSON]
  v2_rowsel_raw_fill.py verify    --out DIR --split-version rowsel-raw-split-v2 --receipt PATH
No S3, GPU or git; nothing is published; network only in tools/l7a_fetch.py (a separate, logged step).
